== Effects ==
* Grants 5 {{e|Bomb}}s.
* Grants all of Isaac's bombs a [[poison]] effect.
* {{dlc|r}} The bombs leave a lingering green poison cloud after exploding.
* {{dlc+|r}} Gives Isaac immunity to poison effects such as those from destroying [[Mushroom (Obstacle)|Mushrooms]] and {{E|Sick Boom Fly}}.{{dlc-}}
* {{transformation contribution|Bob}}

== Notes ==
* This item can drop from killing {{E|Super Sloth}}. {{dlc|nr}} Super Sloth can drop this item even if Isaac has already encountered/possessed it. 

