== Trivia ==
* Despite the item sprite for Bob's Curse having a fuse, the bombs placed lack them.
* The bombs placed after picking up this item resemble the head of {{E|Pestilence}} or {{E|Sloth}}. Bob is also the confirmed first name of Sloth as revealed by a QnA.

